    "text": "Irreversible process<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>nRT</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><munder><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow></munder><mrow></mrow></munder><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8652;</mo><munder><mrow><mn>2</mn><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow></mrow></munder><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8201;&#8201;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd></mtr></mtable></munder><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> on decomposition will give <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8.3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>124500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=124.50</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math>",
